    "collapsible-row-list-3": {
      "type": "collapsible-row-list",
      "blocks": {
        "block-0": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Are all your products vegan and cruelty free?",
            "text": "<p>Yes. We are a PETA certified brand. We don’t use any animal derived ingredients in any of our products and we’re committed to being cruelty free: this means we do not test on animals at any stage of product development, and we will only work with vendors who uphold the same standards. </p>"
          }
        },
        "block-1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "What chemicals are not found in your products?",
            "text": "<p>All our products are free of formaldehyde, sulfates, parabens, silicones and alcohols.</p>"
          }
        },
        "52904234-5e12-43d1-bee1-e3ace3a01213": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Are your products safe for use during pregnancy or while breastfeeding?",
            "text": "<p>Our formulas are free from ingredients that are unsafe during pregnancy. The active ingredient in our keratin treatment, glyoxylic acid, is completely safe for use during both pregnancy and breastfeeding.</p>"
          }
        },
        "block-2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "What does your at-home keratin treatment do?",
            "text": "<p>It is an at-home alternative to expensive salon keratin treatments. One easy application at home results in up to three months of perfectly frizz-free hair. The exclusive VeratinTechTM technology, a 100% vegan keratin, combined with gentle acids, helps control frizz, seal cuticles, and balance your hair’s pH while restoring softness and shine. </p>"
          }
        },
        "block-3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "What are the main benefits?",
            "text": "<ul><li>Unique formula with antioxidant action which proves moisture retention resulting in incredibly smooth and shiny hair</li><li>Hair will maintain its natural body while becoming softer, shinier, and more manageable.</li><li>Quick and easy application process</li><li>Results last up to three months with only one easy application</li><li>Gives you 30 minutes of more sleep each morning as you are free from having to style your hair daily.</li><li>Say goodbye to daily-use of hair iron that burns your hair</li><li>Cuts blow-dry time by half</li><li>Effective on all hair types</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "a07ef016-c732-468c-8bbc-ed06d294ded4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Does it work exactly like salon keratin treatments?",
            "text": "<p>Our at-home keratin treatment has the same effect and gives you the same outcome as the traditional keratin treatments done at the salons.</p>"
          }
        },
        "57b9dd99-3e99-41e9-aebb-1fab4573a56e": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Is it safe to apply the keratin treatment at home?",
            "text": "<p>The treatment is in all ways a safe alternative to traditional chemical-rich salon keratin treatments, as it is 100% formaldehyde-free, making it entirely safe to be performed at home. As the treatment doesn’t consist of any harsh chemicals the treatment doesn’t irritate your scalp and there is no need to use gloves when applying the treatment. However, we do recommend checking the ingredients list to see if you are allergic to any of the natural ingredients included in the formula. Our product may react with some coloured fabrics, to avoid colour fading and stains on your clothes, we recommend using an old towel for covering the shoulders during the treatment.</p>"
          }
        },
        "e9f3e406-409d-44c8-bff0-9b8a2a8db700": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "How is the smooth and silky effect achieved? VERATIN TECH ™ Technology explained.",
            "text": "<p>Typically similar treatments on the market utilize animal sourced keratin and strong chemicals as their active ingredients to achieve effective results. As we believe that looking good should never compromise our health nor our furry friends we use only gentle, high quality ingredients and 100% vegan sourced keratin - without compromising the effectiveness of the treatment. Our own unique combination of 87% natural ingredients and a blend of amino acids is the hero of our exclusive VeratinTech™ technology. VeratinTech™  technology is grounded on the acidic oxoacetamides synergy and utilizes keratin amino acids sourced from wheat and soy. The unique technology enables capillary realignment which results in natural smooth and shiny hair that lasts for up to three months - all this without damaging the hair.</p><p>VeratinTech™  technology is grounded on the acidic oxoacetamides synergy and utilizes keratin amino acids sourced from wheat and soy. The unique technology enables capillary realignment which results in natural smooth and shiny hair that lasts for up to three months - all this without damaging the hair.</p>"
          }
        },
        "cd6b1fa1-8579-46a7-b715-be966848292e": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "What actually happens inside your hair during the treatment?",
            "text": "<p>1. After the application of the treatment, it absorbs to the hair cuticle - the topmost layer of the hair strand.</p><p>2. During the action time, treatment enters the second and thickest layer of the hair strand.</p><p>3. The acids modify the weak and reversible bonds between protein chains.</p><p>4. Amino acids of the vegan keratin creates new links between existing proteins and keratin is absorbed by the core of the hair strand. </p><p>5. The treatment is washed off when the viable links have been fixed. Some stronger bonds, such as ones damaged by bleaching, may not be fixed.</p><p>6. The heat of the iron seals the new bonds and the cuticle back down - making the hair de-frizzed and shiny. </p><p>7. Blow-drying with hot air after each wash makes the cuticles settle down again, which enables the hair to be smooth for up to three months. </p><p>8. Links between protein chains fade gradually with each hair wash. To seal them again, the treatment can be repeated every second month. </p><p>VeratinTech™  technology is grounded on the acidic oxoacetamides synergy and utilizes keratin amino acids sourced from wheat and soy. The unique technology enables capillary realignment which results in natural smooth and shiny hair that lasts for up to three months - all this without damaging the hair.</p>"
          }
        },
        "5f10f569-49e7-4745-b3c8-b11b6ae8ba67": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "What tools are needed for applying the treatment?",
            "text": "<p>Straightening iron,  blow dryer, hair clip, comb, shower, and towel.</p>"
          }
        },
        "d69b7b04-1239-4e57-873d-58deba4f7dc8": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "How many application is one bottle enough for?",
            "text": "<p>The 100ml spray bottle is designed for 1-2 time application, depending on the length and thickness of your hair. Remember that it is vital to apply a generous amount of solution so that your hair is completely saturated</p>"
          }
        },
        "75403838-0726-4675-9454-4381e1adb528": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Does it straighten the hair?",
            "text": "<p>While it de-frizzes and might make your curls appear more loose it won't straighten your hair. After the first wash, your hair's natural volume will resume while the smoothness and shine will remain. On a technical level, our treatment differs from straightening treatments and perms because of the way it works on the hair. Straightening treatments and perms use harsh chemicals that alter the disulfide bonds in the hair to restructure the strands. On the other hand, our treatment uses natural chemicals that work on a different level and target the weaker, modified bonds in the hair. This allows us to achieve smooth, frizz-free locks without damaging the hair.</p>"
          }
        },
        "f445b584-f599-421f-a5c2-fcd53c1c3815": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Does it damage the hair as permanent straightening?",
            "text": "<p>No. The technology of permanent straightening leads to the breakage of the disulfide bridges while our technology only affects the weak and reversible bonds, hence doesn’t damage the hair. It involves formation of cross-links with two or more polypeptide chains. Reversible reactions are created between the fibers and the carbonyl group of the glyoxylic acid.  The centers of the reactions of the fibers are the aminoacids that have particular free chemical groups containing sulfur, oxygen and nitrogen. In this context, the keratin amino acids can also react to create new links and to give new shapes of the hair.</p>"
          }
        },
        "abb4edc1-f934-476e-bbbc-57c476dfd629": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Is it suitable for all hair types?",
            "text": "<p>Yes it is! However, please keep in mind that it will not repair bonds damaged by bleaching treatments. Also colored hair may be subject to fading in color when flat iron is applied on hair - especially if hair has been colored with semi permanent dye. To avoid any fading of you colored hair we recommend passing the iron on a small section of hair and waiting until your hair cools. If you notice any fading, lower the temperature and test it until  you no longer see any fading. </p>"
          }
        },
        "18aad015-c3ed-496c-8204-b3640f2ce898": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "What is the application process?",
            "text": "<p><strong>1. Section & spray.</strong> Divide clean, dry hair into sections and spray on each section until saturated. Usually, this means applying the entire bottle. More is more. </p><p><strong>2. Comb through.</strong> Make sure treatment is evenly distributed and leave your hair open. </p><p><strong>3. Let it act. </strong>Let those botanicals work their magic. 40 minutes for thinner hair; 60 for thicker hair.</p><p><strong>4. Rinse</strong> thoroughly with only water.</p><p><strong>5. Blow-dry</strong> until fully dry. </p><p><strong>6. Straighten.</strong> Comb through thin sections (approx. 2cm wide) slowly and lock in the treatment with a styling iron set to 200°C*. For best results, pass the iron 6 times on each section until entirely straight. </p><p>*On colored hair, test a small section of hair and wait until your hair cools. If you notice any fading, lower the temperature</p>"
          }
        },
        "e6956c87-d256-4b37-9360-11aed43ee1b1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "What should be avoided after the treatment?",
            "text": "<ul><li>Don’t wash your hair for 24 hours. </li><li>Use sulfate-free shampoo and conditioners. Like ours!</li><li>Blow dry after every wash to reactivate the keratin.</li><li>Repeat the treatment after 2 months to keep it smooth. </li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "1a5ad337-71ec-4039-a139-3fb7734f825e": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "How long does the application process take?",
            "text": "<p>It will only take 10 minutes to spray in the treatment after which you let it act for 40-60 minutes. All in all the entire treatment process will take you only 1,5 to 2 hours and it will transform your frizzy and lifeless hair into silky-smooth which will last for up to three months.</p>"
          }
        },
        "cce6d681-3884-4534-aa8c-a166fe15cc3c": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Can I apply it on dry and damaged hair?",
            "text": "<p>The treatment works well to align even dry, porous, bleached hair but it may not restore the aggression already caused by previous chemical products. Please keep in mind that it will not repair bonds damaged by bleaching treatments. The treatment itself does not cause any damage or sensitivity to the hair fibers. But, if the hair is already fragile due to excessive bleaching or/and heavy chemical products, it might appear dry after the treatment as the application process requires sealing the treatment with a hot iron. If you have very damaged ends, we recommend avoiding passing the iron on the ends too excessively.</p>"
          }
        },
        "5ff913f2-530f-49e8-a96a-a5a3402d5053": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Can I go wrong with the application?",
            "text": "<p>There are a few things to avoid in order to achieve the optimal results:</p><ul><li>Not applying enough solution – Remember that your hair needs to be fully wet after spraying in the treatment</li><li>Not letting it act long enough – Remember to let it act for one hour and not less than that</li><li>Leaving the treatment to act for too long</li><li>Not rinsing the treatment properly – remember to wash the solution off entirely leaving no residue</li><li>Straightening too thick sections of hair – Remember to take very tiny (2 cm wide) sections at a time</li><li>Not going over each section of hair 6 times with the iron</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "31f3549a-dec4-4e02-85e8-280c8defbfe6": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Is it suitable for coloured hair?",
            "text": "<p>Yes it is! However, please keep in mind that it will not repair the bonds of bleached hair. Also colored hair may be subject to fading in color when flat iron is applied on hair - especially if hair has been colored with semi permanent dye. To avoid any fading of you colored hair we recommend passing the iron on a small section of hair and waiting until your hair cools. If you notice any fading, lower the temperature and test it until  you no longer see any fading. </p>"
          }
        },
        "a7054f2d-d70d-45d1-b682-2cc2a008be72": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "How often should I reapply the treatment?",
            "text": "<p>The results are semi-permanent, gradually fading over three months after application. To keep your hair at its smoothest and shiniest, we recommend reapplying the treatment every two months for consistently smooth hair.</p>"
          }
        },
        "4d888ffe-7f1b-4d17-8777-1f9bebd2d2bd": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Do you guarantee results?",
            "text": "<p>Yes we do offer a 100% money back guarantee! We guarantee that our keratin treatment will make your hair smoother and silkier than ever. However, please  keep in mind that everyone’s hair is different and results may vary from person to person. For some people the intensity of the shine can be stronger than for others. If you are not happy with the results please get in touch with our support team at <a href=\"mailto:ask@answrbeauty.com\" title=\"mailto:ask@answrbeauty.com\">ask@answrbeauty.com</a></p>"
          }
        }
      },
