    "collapsible-row-list-1": {
      "type": "collapsible-row-list",
      "blocks": {
        "block-0": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "How long does shipping take?",
            "text": "<p>Orders are typically dispatched within 24 hours, and you can expect to receive a shipping confirmation email within that timeframe. Please note that during peak demand periods, processing times may be slightly longer.</p><p>We operate from two warehouse locations, in the UK and Germany, ensuring your order is dispatched from the warehouse closest to your location for optimal delivery times.</p><h3>Standard Delivery Times:</h3><ul><li><strong>UK</strong>: 2–3 business days</li><li><strong>EU Countries</strong>: 4–8 business days</li><li><strong>Rest of the world</strong>: 7–10 business days</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "block-1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "What if I am unable to collect my parcel?",
            "text": "<p>If your parcel is not collected within 10 days, it will be returned to our warehouse. We recommend  contacting the courier directly to arrange a second delivery before it gets returned back. If you are unable to collect the package in person, you may authorize someone else to collect it on your behalf. The authorized person must present:</p><ol><li>A letter of authorization.</li><li>A valid proof of identity.</li></ol>"
          }
        },
        "block-2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Where do you ship the orders from?",
            "text": "<p>We ship all orders from our warehouses in UK and Germany. We ship your order from the warehouse that is closest to you to optimize the shipping time. </p>"
          }
        },
        "block-3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Will my order be subject to duties and VAT charges?",
            "text": "<p>All UK orders are fulfilled from our UK warehouse, so no additional VAT charges apply. Similarly, orders within the EU are shipped from our Germany-based warehouse, ensuring no VAT charges are incurred. For orders shipped outside the UK and EU, duties, tariffs, or other fees may apply depending on the destination country. Please note that ANSWR is not responsible for any such charges; customers are solely responsible for covering any applicable duties, VAT, or additional fees.</p>"
          }
        },
        "21de5c7a-0338-41cf-bc97-86d9c11253c1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Can I change my address after the order has been placed?",
            "text": "<p>If you need to update your shipping address, please email us immediately at <a><strong>ask@answrbeauty.com</strong></a>. We will do our best to amend the address before your order is dispatched. However, as orders are processed promptly, we cannot guarantee changes once the order has been placed. Please note that once an order has been processed, the shipping address cannot be modified. We kindly ask that you double-check your shipping details at checkout to avoid any mistakes.</p>"
          }
        },
        "cb80d39f-3b3a-4743-8aa5-756b5f5d236f": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "How do I track my order?",
            "text": "<p>You will receive an automated shipping confirmation email including a tracking link once your order has been dispatched. If you have any questions regarding tracking please email us at <a href=\"mailto:ask@answrbeauty.com\" title=\"mailto:ask@answrbeauty.com\">ask@answrbeauty.com</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "c40ae887-3b86-4366-b3ba-da3dcd98e242": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Can I amend my order?",
            "text": "<p>Since we begin processing each order as soon as it has been submitted, we are unfortunately unable to amend an order after it has been placed. However, you are always welcome to email us and request a change to your order and we will assist you if possible. We kindly ask that you please take care to double check your details before placing your order.</p>"
          }
        },
        "fb9f5019-6dd9-447e-bfb3-e5e920ca90c4": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "What is your return policy?",
            "text": "<p>Due to the nature of our products and EU health regulations, we cannot accept physical returns. However, we offer a 30-day money-back guarantee if you are not satisfied with your purchase.</p>"
          }
        },
        "3bf17c56-eaad-40c7-9170-9efa74d1c945": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "How does the money-back guarantee work?",
            "text": "<p>We stand by the quality of our products and confidently offer a 30-day money-back guarantee if they do not deliver the desired results.</p><p>To initiate a claim, please email us at <a><strong>ask@answrbeauty.com</strong></a> with the following details:</p><ul><li>Your order number</li><li>Before and after photos</li><li>The lot number (found on the bottom of the bottle)</li><li>Any relevant information about your process, results, hair type, or previous treatments</li></ul><p>Please note that the guarantee applies to your first order only.</p>"
          }
        },
        "6a2fb5e3-41cc-4a9a-9143-a48e10a321c7": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "How will my refund be processed?",
            "text": "<p>Refunds will be issued to the original payment method used when placing your order. Processing times may vary depending on the payment method, but refunds typically appear in your account within 2–10 business days.</p>"
          }
        },
        "9d1df1b5-7c50-4597-9f41-10932258743a": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "How will my refund be processed?",
            "text": "<p>Refunds will be returned to the form of payment used when you placed your order.Refund processing may vary slightly depending on the payment method used but will generally show up on your account in 2-10 business days.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
